5,1,1,talk,George,,We need to understand why the silence happened last month.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I am tired of the administrative burden of every single trip.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,The car is often not ready when I need it most.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,We need to know what a fair share actually costs.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,I just want to see the real numbers for the year.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,George,,"@Minato, yes, the numbers might show the stress points.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@George, the stress is in the coordination, not just the money.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, coordination fails when the car is dirty or empty.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Victoria, state matters, but so does who pays for the wear.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minato,,I will look at the fuel receipts and the tax papers.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,George,,I want to see what other households said about this.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will check the hours recorded in the diary.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I need to see the state of the car at handover.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will look at the fuel receipts and the mechanic's remarks.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minato,,I am curious about the weeks of heavy use too.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,George,,"@Misaki, the mechanic's notes might explain the wear.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Minato, heavy use weeks are where the chaos starts.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"@George, other households' experiences are a good warning.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
