35,2,1,talk,George,,The other households said asking favours was the main problem.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The diary shows Saturday is used three times more than Tuesday.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Victoria,,The car was handed over with the fuel light on twice.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,Two people bought over half the fuel last year.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minato,,"The fixed costs were 280,000 yen before any fuel.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,George,,"@Misaki, that fuel split is very uneven.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Minato, 280,000 yen is a lot for just the basics.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, if Saturday is so busy, we need a system for it.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@George, the checking of figures caused the worst tension.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, the fuel light issue is really frustrating for the next driver.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,George,,We must avoid the feeling of being accused when checking numbers.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"A month of recording took an hour a week, which is too much.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Victoria,,The weekly trips keep collapsing because of the state of the car.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"Short cold runs eat the brakes faster, so usage type matters.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minato,,I think we need a way that doesn't require constant checking.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,George,,"@Minato, a fixed system might reduce the need for checking.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, if we fix the days, the state might improve.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, fixed days might help, but who keeps it clean?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"@George, we need to be careful not to repeat the past mistakes.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minato,,"I agree, we need something simple and fair.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
